---
import StudioLayout from "../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
---
<StudioLayout title="Work with the studio \u2014 Strategic Sloth" description="Partner with Strategic Sloth on game UI, UX, design systems, and product direction.">
<section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S WORK TOGETHER</p><h1>Good ideas deserve<br>thoughtful execution.</h1><p class="lede">Work directly with Remi Couture on game interfaces, creative tools, and the systems that bring a product together.</p></section><section class="section container compact"><div class="three-grid"><article class="plain-card"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Game UI & UX</h3><p>A focused interface pass or a complete system: menus, HUDs, interaction flows, and component states.</p></article><article class="plain-card"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>Design to engine</h3><p>Clear specifications, organized assets, and practical handoffs for Unity, Unreal, Godot, and custom engines.</p></article><article class="plain-card"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>Ongoing collaboration</h3><p>Product direction and design support as your project evolves from concept through production.</p></article></div><section class="engagement-process"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK TOGETHER</p><h2>A clear path from the start.</h2><ol><li><strong>Define the brief</strong><p>Share your project, its current stage, and where you need help.</p></li><li><strong>Agree on the scope</strong><p>Align on priorities, deliverables, timing, and budget before work begins.</p></li><li><strong>Design, review, refine</strong><p>Work through the details together, with a practical handoff to your team.</p></li></ol></section><div class="contact-panel enquiry-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Tell us what you’re building.</h2><p>Share a short project overview, the kind of help you need, and your timeline. We’ll take it from there.</p></div><form class="enquiry-form" data-enquiry-form aria-label="Project enquiry">
<div class="enquiry-fields">
<label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"></label>
<label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"></label>
<label class="enquiry-wide">Confirm email address<input name="emailConfirm" type="email" autocomplete="off" required maxlength="254" aria-describedby="enquiry-email-help"></label>
<p class="enquiry-wide enquiry-help" id="enquiry-email-help">Enter your email again so we can reply to the right address.</p>
<label class="enquiry-wide">Subject<input name="subject" required maxlength="160" placeholder="What would you like to build?" aria-describedby="enquiry-subject-help"></label>
<p class="enquiry-wide enquiry-help" id="enquiry-subject-help">Your email subject will start with [StrategicSloth], followed by your subject.</p>
<label class="enquiry-wide">Project details<textarea name="message" rows="7" required maxlength="6000" placeholder="Tell us about your project, the help you need, and any timeline or budget you have in mind."></textarea></label>
</div>
<p class="enquiry-help">Your draft stays in this browser on this device until you clear it. Opening your email app won’t delete it.</p>
<p class="enquiry-status" data-draft-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Your draft will save as you type.</p>
<label class="enquiry-robot"><input type="checkbox" data-human-confirm required> <span>I’m not a robot</span></label>
<div class="enquiry-actions"><button class="button" type="submit" disabled>Open email draft <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button class="enquiry-clear" type="button" data-clear-draft disabled>Clear draft</button></div>
<p class="enquiry-help" data-send-status role="status">Review and send your enquiry in your email app.</p>
<noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to use the saved draft form, or email <a href="mailto:privacy@strategicsloth.com?subject=%5BStrategicSloth%5D%20Project%20enquiry">privacy@strategicsloth.com</a>.</p></noscript>
</form><p class="contact-address">privacy@strategicsloth.com</p></div><section class="project-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE TALK</p><h2 id="faq-title">A few useful details.</h2><details><summary>Who will I work with?</summary><p>You’ll work directly with Remi Couture, the founder and designer behind Strategic Sloth and SliceForge.</p></details><details><summary>Can we start with a focused piece of work?</summary><p>Yes. A UI review, a menu flow, or a component system can be a useful starting point. We’ll agree on a scope that fits the problem.</p></details><details><summary>What should I include in my enquiry?</summary><p>A short project overview, your engine or platform, the help you need, and your target timing. A budget range also helps shape a realistic scope.</p></details></section></section>
</StudioLayout>
